WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[Screen shows phone contact history list. User selects the "Healthcare" entry to check recent caller activities.]

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:15.500
[User opens detailed contact info for "Healthcare," revealing the phone number: +1 213-694-1250. User copies the number to the clipboard.]

3
00:00:15.500 --> 00:00:21.000
[User switches to the Google search app and pastes the number "+1 213-694-1250" into the search bar.]

4
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:29.500
[Search results load, displaying an AI Overview stating that the number belongs to the L.A. Care Health Plan, a public agency in Los Angeles County.]

5
00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:36.500
[User taps the search bar to access Google Circle to Search / Lens features, selecting the text block on the screen.]

6
00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:44.500
[Google Lens identifies the text selection and displays matching visual results, confirming the organization name and the 1055 W. 7th St. office address.]

7
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:52.000
[User exits the Lens view and scrolls further down the main Google search results page to examine specific plan phone numbers.]

8
00:00:52.000 --> 00:01:07.000
[The screen displays the full L.A. Care "Member Services by Plan" directory, detailing numbers for Medi-Cal, L.A. Care Covered, Medicare Plus, and the physical mailing address at 1200 West 7th Street Los Angeles, CA 90017.]
